# The values of this deployment that are not published: the server's name and
# the addresses of the operator's machines. Copy to site.env (gitignored) and
# fill in. Read by bash (KEY=value; quote a value with spaces) through site.sh:
# stack/deploy.sh, ops/*.sh, cascade/test-client.sh.

# The entry server's DNS name: in the users' configs, the panel's address, the
# smart DNS (https://<DOMAIN>/dns-query).
DOMAIN=vpn.example.net
# The Cloudflare zone DOMAIN is in (ops/switch-entry.sh moves the name).
ZONE=example.net
# Addresses let into the panel (Traefik's allow-list), space separated.
PANEL_ALLOW="203.0.113.10"
# The optional parts this server runs, space separated (none: the mesh alone):
#   cascade   exits abroad: some or all traffic leaves through them (ops/exit.sh, the panel)
#   bot       the Telegram bot: alarms, the daily report, users for the admin
#   smartdns  DNS-over-HTTPS + SNI proxy for devices without the VPN (needs cascade)
#   obs       history and logs: Prometheus, Loki, Alloy, Grafana
#   backup    a dump of the settings once a day on the server
FEATURES=""
# Addresses that may use the smart DNS without a personal code: this machine's
# home address and the exit servers, space separated.
DNS_STATIC="203.0.113.10 198.51.100.1 198.51.100.2"
